@api = http://localhost:5191
@bearer = replace-with-user-access-token
@workflowId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@runId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Restore the most recent run when reopening a workflow
GET {{api}}/api/workflows/{{workflowId}}/runs/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### List earlier runs that still contain generated videos
GET {{api}}/api/workflows/{{workflowId}}/video-runs
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### Quote new AI clips for the saved run configuration
POST {{api}}/api/workflow-runs/{{runId}}/ai-shot-quote
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"regenerate":false}

### Continue after mockup approval; use the token and current revision returned above
POST {{api}}/api/workflow-runs/{{runId}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":1,"action":"resume_mockups","aiShotQuoteToken":"replace-with-quote-token"}

### Inspect run progress
GET {{api}}/api/workflow-runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### Review generated video versions
GET {{api}}/api/workflow-runs/{{runId}}/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
